cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this software and record the exact commit used. A public paper and archival release identifier are forthcoming."
type: software
title: "PSS-WebTest: Research Infrastructure for Computer-Use Agents and Scripted Web Testing"
abstract: >-
  Research infrastructure for comparing screenshot-only and structure-assisted
  computer-use agents with human-authored Playwright scripts. The active design
  connects benchmark-native performance, repeated reliability, recurring errors
  with same-class controls, and complementarity beyond either retry baseline
  across WebArena-Verified, VisualWebArena and ATA. Code, analysis and engineering
  checks are available; full benchmark acceptance and execution-level public
  replication evidence remain separate milestones.
